  "problem": "Categorize the polynomial $3{h}^{4}$ based on its degree and the number of terms it has.",
  "worked_solution": "The polynomial $3{h}^{4}$ has only one term, so it is a monomial.\n\nAlso, its degree is $4,$ so it is a quartic.\n\nTherefore, the polynomial is a quartic monomial.",
